  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Travel costs visit rehabilitation centers in NL</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Purpose of the project is to implement a study visit to the Netherlands (NL) on the rehabilitation centers of the representatives of the Ukrainian Working Group - Ministry of Health (WG-MoH) working on a building code for rehabilitation centers. This visit will enable that 11 members of the WG-MoH get a practical understanding of the Dutch requirements for the gradation of different types of rehabilitation facilities; and the rehabilitation methods that need to be considered in the building codes of Ukraine for rehabilitation facilities. The visit will also facilitate the communication of the delegation with architects who have experience in the design of these type of specialized healthcare facilities; and with Dutch rehabilitation experts in the fields of cardiology, orthopedics, neurology, pediatrics, pulmonology; covering the rehabilitation of civilians and military personnel after injuries as consequence of the ongoing war.</narrative>
  </description>
